READ THE RESULT
==============================================================================
  The prime side is exact integer arithmetic. The smooth side is mpf at the
  recorded dps and is differenced at that precision — never via float.
  Any cell that moved by more than the tolerance between the two precisions is
  reported as UNTRUSTWORTHY, not as a number.
  This script states no hypothesis and fires no decision rule. It is EXPLORATORY
  per CLAUDE.md § Prereg discipline.
